---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Contact ChartGlade"
  description="Reach ChartGlade at hello@chartglade.com — chart requests, print problems, corrections and anything else."
  path="/contact"
>
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Contact</h1>
  </section>

  <section class="prose">
    <p>
      Email <a href="mailto:hello@chartglade.com">hello@chartglade.com</a> — a human reads it.
    </p>
    <p>Worth writing about:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Chart requests.</strong> A chart you need that isn't here yet — this is the #1 way the library grows.</li>
      <li><strong>Print problems.</strong> Something clipped, tiny, or sideways on your printer; tell us the browser and printer and we'll fix the stylesheet.</li>
      <li><strong>Corrections.</strong> A wrong fact on a teaching note — we'd rather know today.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      We don't do guest posts, link exchanges, or sponsored content, so those emails can stay unwritten.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
